176
00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:34.214
The complete venue prompt has a purpose, a
source-use policy,

177
00:15:34.214 --> 00:15:38.429
the four records, ordered instructions,
hard constraints, a deliverable,

178
00:15:38.429 --> 00:15:42.643
verification checks, and a
missing-information policy. Its purpose is

179
00:15:42.643 --> 00:15:46.857
to help an event planner make a
