191
00:16:33.435 --> 00:16:37.870
It is not a live model run, tool call,

192
00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:42.304
venue inquiry, reservation, transaction,
or independent verification. Decision:

193
00:16:42.304 --> 00:16:46.739
